  "details": "Any video player will quickly desync, where the video lags behind the audio. The video will noticeably stutter every few seconds, but the audio will continue smoothly. This has been happening for quite a while now, including through different video driver updates, Windows updates and BIOS updates.\n\nThis happens in any world with any video player.\n\nSoftware:\n\nWindows 11 25H2, Build 6200.7462\n\nSteamVR, version 2.14.5\n\nAMD Adrenaline Driver, version 25.12.1\n\nAMD Chipset Driver, version 7.11.26.2142\n\nHardware:\n\nValve Index headset\n\nMSI Radeon RX 6950 XT\n\nAsus TUF Gaming X670E-Plus WiFi, BIOS 3602\n\nAMD Ryzen 7 7800X3D",
